<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n730" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγνος</span></b> , ἡ, 
			Att.
		
		ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύγος</span>
			, <i>chaste-tree</i>, the branches of which were strewed by
			matrons on their beds at the Thesmophoria, <i>Vitex Agnus-castus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				410
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Chionid.
				2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				396
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				230b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Int.</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
			</span></i><i>H A</i><i><span class="en">
				627a9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				71
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.103
			</span></i>. (Associated with the notion of chastity from the
			like ness of its name to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁγνός.</span>) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγνος, ὁ</span>,
			name of <i>a fish,</i>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλλιώνυμος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Diph.Siph.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				8.356a
			</span></i> (sine acc. cod., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁγνός</span>
			Kaib.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> a kind of
				<i>bird</i>, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
			</span></i>l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
